# In the Mood for Love (jeuno 69): Lower Jeuno's Odasel (no script; default 162) and Matoaka (script: her shop). A level
# 75 Warrior, CoP The Road Forks current (past A Vessel Without a Captain), two Chameleon Diamonds and a Chocobo Feather.
# Available: 10035 (0, Chameleon Diamond): begun. Accepted: Odasel's 10037 (0, Chameleon Diamond); Matoaka: no section
# (her shop); two diamonds: nil; the diamond and the feather: nil; the diamond: 10036, finished: completed (4800 gil,
# Pick-up Artist), fame +7 x3, the diamond taken, Option 1. Completed: Odasel's 10038; the other diamond: no onTrade; Matoaka at Option 1: 10039 (Option
# 0); again: nil (her shop).
lists LowerJeuno/Odasel/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Odasel/onTrade LowerJeuno/Matoaka/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10035 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10036 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10039
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-56.9,-6,-111.7 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Cop TheRoadForks current
item ChameleonDiamond x2
item ChocoboFeather
login
trigger Odasel                          # available: 10035 (0, Chameleon Diamond)
finish                                  # begun
trigger Odasel                          # accepted: 10037
finish
warp -35.7,-6.1,-121.9 LowerJeuno       # by Matoaka
trigger Matoaka                         # accepted: no section; her shop
warp -56.9,-6,-111.7 LowerJeuno         # by Odasel
trade Odasel ChameleonDiamond x2        # two: nil; nothing
trade Odasel ChameleonDiamond x1 ChocoboFeather x1 # an extra item: nil
trade Odasel ChameleonDiamond x1        # 10036
finish                                  # completed: 4800 gil, Pick-up Artist; fame +7 x3; the diamond taken; Option 1
trigger Odasel                          # completed: 10038
finish
trade Odasel ChameleonDiamond x1        # completed: no onTrade: nothing (the second diamond kept)
warp -35.7,-6.1,-121.9 LowerJeuno       # by Matoaka
trigger Matoaka                         # Option 1: 10039
finish                                  # Option 0
trigger Matoaka                         # Option 0: nil; her shop
